{"4908110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gas N Cars", "steam_appid": 4908110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/207f419718c8bd92b461dcee00a68d84.avif?t=1787928773\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras_big/207f419718c8bd92b461dcee00a68d84.webp?t=1787928773 width=1560 height=390 /></span><strong>⛽ Serve Customers &amp; Fuel Cars </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up cars with the right fuel, stop at the right amount, and get paid for a job well done. Be precise, move fast, and keep customers happy… or mess things up and watch their reactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧽 Clean, Repair &amp; Upgrade Cars</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cars arrive dirty, broken, or missing parts. Clean them, repair them, replace car parts, and earn extra cash for good service. The better you work, the better your rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨 Steal Parts, Break Cars &amp; Create Chaos </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t feel like being a perfect employee? Steal mirrors, break windows, damage cars, spray fuel everywhere. Every tool can become a source of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚚 Buy New Tools From the Delivery Truck</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delivery truck regularly stops by with new tools, weapons, items, and consumables. Spend your cash to unlock more ways to serve customers, prank them, or completely ruin their day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Paint, Burn, Spray &amp; Experiment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spray paint, fuel, lighters, weird items, and other tools to experiment with customers and cars.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚓 Catch Wanted Fugitives</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheriff may ask for your help. Watch the queue, identify wanted drivers, and stop them to earn special rewards. Serve them normally… or take them down your own way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ Earn Cash, Reviews &amp; Climb the Leaderboard</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, collect money, unlock new tools, and build your reputation. Customers leave reviews based on what happened to them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/6728ed90adbaf0c29948f76dad61b543.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/6728ed90adbaf0c29948f76dad61b543.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/6728ed90adbaf0c29948f76dad61b543.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/207f419718c8bd92b461dcee00a68d84.avif?t=1787928773\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras_big/207f419718c8bd92b461dcee00a68d84.webp?t=1787928773 width=1560 height=390 /></span><strong>⛽ Serve Customers &amp; Fuel Cars </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up cars with the right fuel, stop at the right amount, and get paid for a job well done. Be precise, move fast, and keep customers happy… or mess things up and watch their reactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧽 Clean, Repair &amp; Upgrade Cars</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cars arrive dirty, broken, or missing parts. Clean them, repair them, replace car parts, and earn extra cash for good service. The better you work, the better your rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/a039c7b1b3c03fa60644c96521bc61b8.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨 Steal Parts, Break Cars &amp; Create Chaos </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t feel like being a perfect employee? Steal mirrors, break windows, damage cars, spray fuel everywhere. Every tool can become a source of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/bf97a7e3b3326345241e144353c65f3a.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚚 Buy New Tools From the Delivery Truck</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delivery truck regularly stops by with new tools, weapons, items, and consumables. Spend your cash to unlock more ways to serve customers, prank them, or completely ruin their day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/cfb575722225b53a225e5fed3e2a5943.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Paint, Burn, Spray &amp; Experiment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use spray paint, fuel, lighters, weird items, and other tools to experiment with customers and cars.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/7c2fda73132101ecce330a01d0651275.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🚓 Catch Wanted Fugitives</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheriff may ask for your help. Watch the queue, identify wanted drivers, and stop them to earn special rewards. Serve them normally… or take them down your own way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.poster.avif?t=1787928773\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.webm?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908110/extras/5ddff118cc14f0da95071bbd413eb851.mp4?t=1787928773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ Earn Cash, Reviews &amp; Climb the Leaderboard</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, collect money, unlock new tools, and build your reputation. Customers leave revi